### Windows Security Telemetry Validation

Verified that Windows events from the lab endpoints were reaching Splunk.

Initial search:

```spl
index=* host="WIN11-02"
```

Successful authentication telemetry was validated using:

```spl
index=* host="WIN11-02" EventCode=4624
```

Failed authentication telemetry was identified using:

```spl
index=* EventCode=4625
```

Event ID 4625 represents:

```text
An account failed to log on
```

This established Windows Security Event Logs as the telemetry source for DET-002.

