## DET-002 Development

Created:

```text
DET-002 — Repeated Failed Authentication Detection
```

Detection objective:

> Identify accounts generating repeated Windows authentication failures within a short period.

Lab threshold:

```text
5 or more failed authentication events
within
5 minutes
```

Detection SPL:

```spl
index=* EventCode=4625 earliest=-5m
| stats count as failures by TargetUserName
| where failures>=5
```

Portfolio-formatted output:

```spl
index=* EventCode=4625 earliest=-5m
| stats count as failures by TargetUserName
| where failures>=5
| eval detection="DET-002 - Repeated Failed Authentication"
| table detection TargetUserName failures
```

The detection uses behavioral aggregation rather than identifying a particular authentication tool.

